OL,3,AWhy is the Microsoft outage lasting so
OL,4,Along?
OL,5,
OL,6,FA major Microsoft outage has impacted
OL,7,Fschools, healthcare systems, courts and
OL,8,Fgovernments around the world, with
OL,9,Fusers struggling to access emails and
OL,10,Fartificial intelligence products.
OL,12,FEfforts to completely resume services
OL,13,Fremain ongoing after issues were first
OL,14,Fexperienced on Thursday.
OL,16,FMicrosoft said the outage was not
OL,17,Fcaused by a cyber-security incident.
OL,19,FHere's what we know about the services
OL,20,Faffected and what went wrong.
